The reference project for the Generic Adapter (#118): a Next.js app set up by
the shadcn CLI (shadcn 4.22.0 in its lockfile) with style radix-nova, base
colour neutral and CSS variables (the `init --base radix --preset nova` setup
spec #103 names), plus the alert, button, card, input, label, select, sonner
and textarea components, as source plus its package-lock.json.

Origin: copied unchanged from prototypes/source-link/v0-app/ on branch
prototype/source-link, commit c2b4f98ef087ba5af4b4f32f0edcbf6da713ce7f, where
the shadcn CLI installed it. Nothing was fetched from the shadcn registry for
this copy. Left out: that app's own sample pages (app/page.tsx,
app/request-access-form.tsx, app/api/, components/submit-button.tsx), its
README, favicon and public/ images.

